    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "La siguiente consulta SQL para BigQuery calcula el porcentaje de pacientes que consumen cada fármaco perteneciente a la clase terapéutica de antitrombinas, utilizando los conceptos aprobados y las tablas especificadas:\n\n```sql\nWITH TotalPatients AS (\n    SELECT\n        COUNT(DISTINCT person_id) AS total_persons\n    FROM\n        `drug_era`\n),\nAntithrombinDrugPatients AS (\n    SELECT\n        de.drug_concept_id,\n        c.concept_name AS drug_name,\n        COUNT(DISTINCT de.person_id) AS patients_with_drug\n    FROM\n        `drug_era` AS de\n    JOIN\n        `concept_ancestor` AS ca\n        ON de.drug_concept_id = ca.descendant_concept_id\n    JOIN\n        `concept` AS c\n        ON de.drug_concept_id = c.concept_id\n    WHERE\n        ca.ancestor_concept_id = 4324992 -- Concept ID para 'Antithrombotics'\n    GROUP BY\n        de.drug_concept_id,\n        c.concept_name\n)\nSELECT\n    adp.drug_name,\n    adp.patients_with_drug,\n    tp.total_persons,\n    CAST(adp.patients_with_drug AS BIGNUMERIC) * 100 / tp.total_persons AS percentage_of_patients\nFROM\n    AntithrombinDrugPatients AS adp,\n    TotalPatients AS tp\nORDER BY\n    percentage_of_patients DESC;\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CnEBjz1rX9ZSqQKUeUE4_FwTnUS63qdF_bLdkbmxt7E-xP45pr1VKmTkJ2Aj04qk411kehp84Vj-CHV7qO7A0eP78REdpSCLiHDxBeEEfyddnxEUsUTVxBHjGwF_3t122Pa5mJQ5Nk98kdBpC-y7VXSaaA=="
